  "prefLabel": "Pda 708.02 Requirements for Petition for Reconsideration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 708.02 Requirements for Petition for Reconsideration. A petition for reconsideration shall:\n\n(a) Specify the date of the challenged decision;\n\n(b) Specify every reason that the action taken by the division director was unlawful or unreasonable, including any error of law or error of fact;\n\n(c) Include as an attachment a copy of the application or request that was denied or failed to receive approval; and\n\n(d) Include any new or additional information relevant to the matter proposed for reconsideration.\n\nSource. #8845, eff 3-21-07; ss by #10949, eff 10-20-15; ss by #14376, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
